{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "dealoware-inbound-connectors",
		"name": "Dealoware PoC — Inbound Connectors",
		"description": "Inbound connector tests for the Dealoware PoC.\n\n## Contract (locked)\n\nInbound is a connector they call:\n- Grok attaches a connector or a public MCP.\n- Muse calls an API or MCP we expose.\n- A dot uses account plugins.\n\nThese three stay apart — three separate HTTP requests.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Ensure API is running: `dotnet run --project src/Dealoware.Api`\n2. Verify: GET `{{baseUrl}}/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`\n3. Run folders in order: 01-Bootstrap → 02-Create-Negotiation → 03-Inbound-Connectors\n\n## Variables\n\nThe collection auto-captures credentials and IDs via Tests scripts.\n\n## Authentication\n\nAll protected endpoints use `Authorization: ApiKey {{...ApiKey}}`\n\nRegister: POST /auth/register with displayName → receive apiKey (store securely, shown once only)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:5287",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "sellerApiKey",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "buyerApiKey",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "sellerSub",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "buyerSub",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "artifactId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "negotiationId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "00-Health-Check",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Health Check (No Auth)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has status ok\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql(\"ok\");",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["health"]
						},
						"description": "Verify the API is running. No authentication required."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Verify the API is running before starting scenarios."
		},
		{
			"name": "01-Bootstrap",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register Seller",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has required fields\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('sub');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('apiKey');",
									"});",
									"",
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set(\"sellerApiKey\", jsonData.apiKey);",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set(\"sellerSub\", jsonData.sub);",
									"console.log(\"Seller registered - Sub: \" + jsonData.sub);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Seller\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
